[11.055218, "o", "\u001b[29A\u001b[1G\u001b[K  \u001b[38;5;210m\u2588\u2580\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2588 \u2580 \u2588 \u001b[38;5;222m\u2584\u2588\u2584\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K  \u001b]8;;https://www.superinference.org\u0007\u001b[2mwww.superinference.org\u001b[22m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[2mv0.7.4\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[90m  Provider: anthropic-vertex\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[90m  Model: claude-sonnet-4-5\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[90mWorking directory: /tmp/ami-demo-xp7z2V\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[90mSession: session-20261113-134221-559-0\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[90mPermissions: auto-allow\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[90mTip: Run \u001b[1mami --skill <name>\u001b[22m to pin a skill stance for the session.\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[2m\u2298 Indexing skipped: no project root found\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255m > Create a Python script called fmt_date.py that takes a date string and a custom format spec, then\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255m prints the formatted result. The format spec uses {year}, {month}, {day}, {weekday} placeholders. \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mUse this input: date_str='2025-03-15', fmt='{weekday}, {month} {day}, {year}'. The script should \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mparse the date, build a dict of parts, and substitute them into the format string \u2014 but introduce a \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255msubtle bug: populate the dict with a key called 'dow' instead of 'weekday', so it crashes with a \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mKeyError on that input. Run the script to show the crash, then diagnose the traceback, fix the root \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mcause so the key matches the placeholder, and re-run it to print the correctly formatted date. \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;167m|\u001b[39m Marinating \u001b[2m0.0s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;239m\u001b[2m\u2500\u2500 \u001b[22m\u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;35m\u2713 Pasted 684 chars\u001b[22m\u001b[38;5;239m\u001b[2m \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500 \u001b[22m\u001b[38;5;35mCreate a Python script called\u2026\u001b[38;5;239m\u001b[2m \u2500\u2500\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;167m\u25ba\u001b[39m \u001b[7m \u001b[27m\u001b[2m                                                                        Press \u2191 to recall history\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n"]
